# Paths are relative to the CMake.app bundle root (the commonprefix of the
# macOS tarball). Keep only the CLI tools and their data: the cmake/ctest/cpack
# binaries link system frameworks only (verified: no LC_RPATH into the bundle),
# so dropping Qt Frameworks, PlugIns, cmake-gui, Resources and docs is safe and
# removes most of the bundle's size. The bundle_subdir remap then lifts these to
# cmake/bin and cmake/share to match Linux/Windows.
Contents/bin/cmake
Contents/bin/cpack
Contents/bin/ctest
Contents/share
